{"4289490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NoWay", "steam_appid": 4289490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289490/extras/d600b96502f34b26511d4a713aa64ec3.poster.avif?t=1787491241\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289490/extras/d600b96502f34b26511d4a713aa64ec3.webm?t=1787491241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289490/extras/d600b96502f34b26511d4a713aa64ec3.mp4?t=1787491241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NOWAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hide in the dark, stay quiet, and escape the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">NoWay is a first-person survival horror game where violence is not the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Darkness is not your enemy. This time, it is your shelter.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">NoWay is a first-person survival horror game about silence, fear, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289490/extras/77ff8642578e37974927ddf106596194.poster.avif?t=1787491241\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289490/extras/77ff8642578e37974927ddf106596194.webm?t=1787491241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289490/extras/77ff8642578e37974927ddf106596194.mp4?t=1787491241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hide in the dark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stay quiet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Avoid the infected. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Manage your light. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Violence is not the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289490/extras/8d1cac67e091275ef07b3cf8db16627f.poster.avif?t=1787491241\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289490/extras/8d1cac67e091275ef07b3cf8db16627f.webm?t=1787491241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289490/extras/8d1cac67e091275ef07b3cf8db16627f.mp4?t=1787491241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- First-person survival horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Stealth and escape-focused gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Darkness can protect you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Sound can expose you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- No direct combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">- Light is both a tool and a risk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\